        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1858, 4 x 10 Flush Pull Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 4\" x 10\" flush push/pull plates are normally used for restaurants, industry  or commercial doors. Made of durable solid stainless steel for many years of everyday use. For use with sliding or swinging type doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1858_size.gif?v=1704354593\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1858 4 x 10 Flush Pull Plate size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese flush pull plates great design allows it to be used as a push plate, and the cup pull also allows it to be door pull, with no protruding handles. Great for double acting doors (doors that swing in both directions). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1858-630 Flush Push/Pull Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 16 Gauge (.060\")</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Opening Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Opening Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Opening Depth: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: 630 Brushed Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 4 #8 x 3/4\" Stainless Sheet Metal Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1858.pdf?v=1704262238\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1858 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (with installation hardware).</b>\r\n</p>",
