                "title": "4 x 10 Flush Pull Plate, Don-Jo 1858",
                "description": "Don-Jo 1858 4 x 10 flush push/pull plates are normally used for restaurants, industry  or commercial doors. Made of durable solid stainless steel for many years of everyday use. For use with sliding or swinging type doors. These large flush pull plates great design allows it to be used as a push plate, and the cup pull also allows it to be door pull, with no protruding handles. Great for double acting doors (doors that swing in both directions). ",
